@@ -3,3 +3,6 @@ Properties: `{"Data": "%content%"}` — `Algorithm` is absent because the step d
 
 Step text: `hash %content% with sha256, write to %hash%`
 Properties: `{"Data": "%content%", "Algorithm": "sha256"}`
+
+Step text: `hash the file 'x.bin' with sha256, write to %hash%`
+Properties: `crypto.hash(Data:path="x.bin", Algorithm="sha256")` — "the file X" hashes the file's CONTENTS: Data takes the open slot's path type (`Data:path=...`), not a plain `Data="x.bin"` (which would hash the name "x.bin").
